  "resource": {
    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<h2>Create new users</h2>\n<aside class=\"admonition note\">\n<p class=\"first admonition-title\">Note</p>\n<p class=\"last\">This requires <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_module_mod_admin_identity\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">mod_admin_identity</span></a> to be enabled.</p>\n</aside>\n<p>In the admin, under ‘Auth’ &gt; ‘Users’ you can find a list of all users. Use the\n‘Make a new user’ button to create a new user with a username/password identity.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
